        {
          "question": "Did the pre-charge delay cause sufficient prejudice and abuse of process to breach the McGraths' rights under sections 7 and 11(d) of the Charter and justify a stay?",
          "answers": [
            {
              "answer": "Yes. The delay caused real trial prejudice, the state's treatment also undermined the integrity of the process, and a judicial stay was warranted.",
